```html
<button id="details-button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="details">Details</button>
<section id="details" hidden><a href="/full-details">Full details</a></section>
<script>
  const button = document.querySelector('#details-button');
  const panel = document.querySelector('#details');
  button.addEventListener('click', () => {
    panel.hidden = !panel.hidden;
    button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!panel.hidden));
  });
</script>
```
The hidden attribute removes the closed region from layout and focus while the button exposes its state.

